EFYQ7kNvwEI-2yu&_nc_oc=Adld7dvsPcNAF4KQlut-QzLO6iatlY-FE-ptPkwfSKhK3ccjb7mUxV1VDQSwMoLDB4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzCqcZqxdVX3MOZpkcW0CmAMpa01FoLXk2tqhvOl0W6_g&oe=69B55635"}, "display_name": "Burning of Magnesium Ribbon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab is a groundbreaking educational tool that transforms how we learn about chemical reactions, offering an immersive and captivating experience for users to dive into the combustion of magnesium ribbon. Inside this virtual laboratory, users can engage in hands-on experimentation, explore the substances' unique properties, and witness the mesmerizing reactions that occur within a secure and interactive environment.\n\nA virtual lab assistant readily available for guidance and support is navigating you through this experiment. Additionally, users can conduct independent experiments, solidifying their understanding without relying on a lab assistant.\n\nThis innovative platform takes learning to new heights by simulating these experiments in an immersive and interactive manner, ensuring a profound understanding of the combustion of magnesium ribbon and facilitating long-lasting retention of knowledge.", "short_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab is a groundbreaking educational tool that transforms how we learn about chemical reactions, offering an immersive and captivating experience for users to dive into the combustion of magnesium ribbon. Inside this virtual laboratory, users can engage in hands-on experimentation, explore the substances' unique properties, and witness the mesmerizing reactions that occur within a secure and interactive environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": nu